  {
   "id": 504705,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Determine if 54 is divisible by 9. ",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>You can test if the number is divisible by 9. Add the digits together. If that sum is divisible by 9, then so is the original number.</p>\n<p>5 + 4 = 9, so 54 is divisible by 9.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Yes. When 54 is divided by 9, the result is 6 with no remainder. Also, 54 can be written as the product of 9 and 6."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
